  "description": "RingMo-Agent is a unified remote sensing foundation model for multi-platform and multi-modal reasoning, supporting perception and reasoning tasks across optical, SAR, and infrared modalities from both satellite and UAV platforms. It leverages a large-scale vision-language dataset (RS-VL3M) with over 3 million image-text pairs and introduces modality-adaptive representations and a token-based high-dimensional hidden state decoding mechanism for long-horizon spatial tasks.",
